#: ../plugins/maps.rst:3 2c98e45cbf88451491b6832a9493ebf3
msgid "Maps"
msgstr "Карты"

#: ../plugins/maps.rst:5 50a63ae577534f48a86fc9f66c840971
msgid "This plugin provides:"
msgstr "Этот плагин дает:"

#: ../plugins/maps.rst:7 27d9307a5299409098eb6673dab65d6a
msgid ""
"possibility to store geographical coordinates for members (latitude and "
"longitude),"
msgstr "возможность сохранять координаты для членов (широта и долгота)"

#: ../plugins/maps.rst:8 bc4d1e7a9c454ea9889bd51eb80ee630
msgid ""
"a public map displaying up to date members that have chosen to be publicly "
"visible."
msgstr ""
"публичная карта показывает членов в реальном времени если они выбрали быть "
"публично видимыми"

#: ../plugins/maps.rst:11 462730ad7d6d43ce95bacfbbd690d7e7
msgid "Installation"
msgstr "Установка"

#: ../plugins/maps.rst:13 8d8bcfc7e410426b89b12f402a331d48
msgid "First of all, download the plugin:"
msgstr "Прежде всего, загрузите плагин:"

#: ../plugins/maps.rst:15 2b527bdf6e7545b4985ab1c88a349b2a
msgid "Get latest Maps plugin!"
msgstr "Получите последнюю версию плагина Карты!"

#: ../plugins/maps.rst:19 4821dc6bbf9741eebf79fcdd8a5ce14a
msgid "Get Maps plugin nightly build!"
msgstr "Получите ночную сборку плагина Карты!"

#: ../plugins/maps.rst:23 94895d99ad8f4547addc8d63795a92c3
msgid ""
"Extract the downloaded archive in Galette ``plugins`` directory. For "
"example, under linux (replacing `{url}` and `{version}` with correct values):"
msgstr ""
"Распакуйте скачанный архив в папку Galette ``plugins``. Например, под linux "
"(заменив `{url}` и `{version}` на правильные значения):"

#: ../plugins/maps.rst:33 8480fd996d234918a5e2d0ef0fd71235
msgid "Database initialisation"
msgstr "Установка БД"

#: ../plugins/maps.rst:35 7e4622c81f3a48c2ad0422bf7a3c50bc
msgid ""
"In order to work, this plugin requires several tables in the database. "
"See :ref:`Galette plugins management interface <plugins_managment>`."
msgstr ""
"Для работы плагин требует несколько таблиц в БД. Смотри :ref:`Galette "
"plugins management interface <plugins_managment>`."

#: ../plugins/maps.rst:37 a1a0e673002b4b0c8dc42a42ae4cebeb
msgid "And this is finished; Maps plugin is installed :)"
msgstr "Все готово; Плагин Карты установлен :)"

#: ../plugins/maps.rst:40 9071968bec854f0ba85f104cca12e6d3
msgid "Background map"
msgstr ""

#: ../plugins/maps.rst:44 fab12b4243d34cc99bc8d8cce7efeea8
msgid ""
"The provider is a an administrator changes it from `Maps settings`, in the "
"`Configuration` menu, and the change applies immediately, with no upgrade to "
"wait for."
msgstr ""

#: ../plugins/maps.rst:51 d6680dce7c894a39b69627b90dcca50c
msgid "Several providers are proposed:"
msgstr ""

#: ../plugins/maps.rst:53 ef655d8d757a49a2b277f1ac9318fe77
msgid ""
"**OpenFreeMap, light grey** — the default. Vector tiles, in a discreet grey "
"that lets member markers stand out. No account, no API key, and the service "
"can be `self-hosted <https://openfreemap.org>`_."
msgstr ""

#: ../plugins/maps.rst:56 579d576f278f4233ad519b25b5dfd8cf
msgid "**OpenFreeMap, colours** — the same service, rendered in full colour."
msgstr ""

#: ../plugins/maps.rst:57 e315764389f1416db919ad2b8f0569ee
msgid ""
"**OpenStreetMap** — the standard rendering, from the OpenStreetMap "
"Foundation servers."
msgstr ""

#: ../plugins/maps.rst:59 7d6f6030050f4c94b78d867472a5c10d
msgid ""
"**OpenStreetMap France** and **Humanitarian OSM Team** — hosted by the OSM-"
"FR association; the second one gives more weight to roads and facilities."
msgstr ""

#: ../plugins/maps.rst:61 1c81216774014767ac4732471a46f10b
msgid "**OpenStreetMap Germany** — German rendering, favouring local names."
msgstr ""

#: ../plugins/maps.rst:62 e26c9b03ef824a9fb5a48a8d41cbf143
msgid ""
"**Esri, light grey** — a very light grey rendering, close to what the plugin "
"displayed before version 2.3.0."
msgstr ""

#: ../plugins/maps.rst:66 397d90126e9f4a2992f84d06ee20b347
msgid "Own values"
msgstr ""

#: ../plugins/maps.rst:70 d958d48ba8cb407da1d3d70911d4f6de
msgid ""
"Check the usage policy of the provider you choose. Most of them are run by "
"associations or by volunteers, and they set conditions on the traffic they "
"accept."
msgstr ""

#: ../plugins/maps.rst:74 a21c390d1e7d4fd3aa84662f3d9c6cfe
msgid ""
"The last entry of the list, `Own values`, replaces the proposed providers "
"with an address of your own — a provider that is not listed, or your own "
"tile server."
msgstr ""

#: ../plugins/maps.rst:81 ca1f0287ad194d8c9084115685d32be0
msgid ""
"**Vector tiles** tells the plugin what it is being given: a MapLibre style "
"when ticked, classic raster tiles when not."
msgstr ""

#: ../plugins/maps.rst:83 18311bf1ae614a079dfb005a7ab046f3
msgid ""
"**Address** is the style address for vector tiles, and the tiles address for "
"raster ones, such as ``https://tile.openstreetmap.org/{z}/{x}/{y}.png``."
msgstr ""

#: ../plugins/maps.rst:85 bc0d80c29fc242dfb5f6639afe778b47
msgid ""
"**Attribution** is the credit the provider requires. HTML is allowed. It is "
"not a formality: data licences make it mandatory. A vector style usually "
"carries its own credit, and the field can then be left empty."
msgstr ""

#: ../plugins/maps.rst:88 dbe54582517546028d592776c524e0cd
msgid ""
"**Maximum zoom** is the deepest zoom level the provider serves. Going past "
"it displays empty tiles."
msgstr ""

#: ../plugins/maps.rst:90 a460cd522bd7446186a3dac731cd91dc
msgid ""
"**Subdomains** lists the letters the ``{s}`` token of the address is "
"replaced with, for instance ``abc``. Raster tiles only."
msgstr ""

#: ../plugins/maps.rst:94 753c3bcf36c141cc9c30d49db449cc5c
msgid "Plugin usage"
msgstr "Использование плагина"

#: ../plugins/maps.rst:96 dbb7a57fa9544d7fbd64ef9f24c42b2f
msgid ""
"When the plugin is installed, a group `Maps` is added to Galette menu when a "
"member is logged in, which contains `My location` entry. This page allow "
"member to store its location."
msgstr ""
"Когда плагин установлен, группа \"Maps\" добавляется в меню Galette когда "
"член входит в систему, В ней присутствует поле \"Мое расположение\". Эта "
"страница позволяет члену сохранять свою локацию."

#: ../plugins/maps.rst:98 f83b03ccea9d4820ae440bfd9574fe6f
msgid ""
"A `Geolocalize` button is also added when displaying a member, that allows "
"administrators to set member coordinates."
msgstr ""
"Кнопка \"Геолокализация\" также добавляется при отображении члена, что "
"позволяет администрации устанавливать координаты членов."

#: ../plugins/maps.rst:100 1a4fe2a8986c446489421d6a7b0e5af9
msgid ""
"Also, a `Map` entry is added in public pages list, that displays "
"geolocalized members that are up to date. Administrators and staff members "
"will see all members, while simple members and visitors will only see up to "
"date public ones."
msgstr ""
"Также в список публичных страниц добавлена запись \"Карта\" которая "
"показывает геолокализированых членов в реальном времени. Администрация и "
"сотрудники будут видеть всех членов, а члены и посетители только публичных."

#: ../plugins/maps.rst:102 b80f0567d12b4e9a8692d5f50cc9d3d1
msgid ""
"First of all, members will enter their location coordinates. Several options "
"are provided:"
msgstr "Для начала все члены введут свои координаты. Дано несколько вариантов:"

#: ../plugins/maps.rst:104 8dd95afb56774e0c9424d7279abfc641
msgid ""
"if town has been set in member information, a list of possible places will "
"be proposed (via `Nominatim online service <https://"
"nominatim.openstreetmap.org>`_),"
msgstr ""
"если город был указан в информации про члена, будет предоставлен список "
"возможных локаций (через \"Nominatim online service<https://"
"nominatim.openstreetmap.org>\"_),"

#: ../plugins/maps.rst:105 2f0ef69f61714a87be9ae858f3dd661c
msgid ""
"additionally, a search zone (provided from `OpenStreetMap <https://"
"nominatim.openstreetmap.org/>`_),"
msgstr ""
"кроме этого зона поиска (предоставлена \"OpenStreetMap <https://"
"nominatim.openstreetmap.org/>\"_),"

#: ../plugins/maps.rst:106 d631c33ad3a444008e642727a649d8c8
#, fuzzy
msgid "and also a geolocalize button using browser capacities."
msgstr "а также кнопка геолокализации с помощью возможностей браузера."

#: ../plugins/maps.rst:108 26c3751faa9e481a92364e3fa4c9c836
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"The search zone can be used when saving members location, and when "
"displaying the maps."
msgstr ""
"Зона поиска может использоватся при сохранении локации члена, и демонстрации "
"карт."

#: ../plugins/maps.rst:114 438b358e476b4feb8c1faffe2241c5a3
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"A member can define its location (with the precision he wants) on the map "
"selecting one of the propositions:"
msgstr ""
"Член может определить свою локацию (с желаемой точностью) на карте выбрав "
"один из вариантов:"

#: ../plugins/maps.rst:120 c992a4fa34474737b609a73b224dcc01
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Using the geolocalization button will define its position from the browser:"
msgstr "Использование кнопки геолокизации определит позицию из браузера:"

#: ../plugins/maps.rst:126 d796b6e909064bd0add6717ca0dadbff
#, fuzzy
msgid "Then, member location is displayed on map, and can be removed:"
msgstr "Потом локация члена показывается на карте и может быть удалена:"
